      "text": "The change adds requested module paths, built from the trusted imports, the protected base module and every `.olean` under the trusted and candidate roots, to the import search path that the bundle preparation uses; owner review required. Fix: get the owner's review of how the new requested-module list affects the trusted import resolution."
